# PLAN-NEXT: stretch 0: test IsPristine v0 builtinClass=Array aspects=[Storage] on b0.0; test HasArrayStorage v0 arrayStorage=Double on b0.0; test IsInBounds v0, {{*}} before v9; uses v9; cloned
